> **Tip:** If your app needs province‑specific long weekends (e.g., Family Day in Alberta vs. no Family Day in Ontario), you’ll want to merge this federal list with the provincial holiday calendars. The Canadian government publishes each province’s holiday schedule on the *Canada.ca* website, which you can scrape or pull via an API if you have one.

Let me know if you’d like the provincial variations or any other formatting tweaks!
